# src/apps/daemon/internal/integrations/relayclient

## Purpose
External relay adapters (GSA/serverless), relay wire types, and their dial behavior behind one integration module.

## Architectural role
- Daemon dependency band: `integrations` (rank 3; lower rank = deeper implementation).
- Cross-band imports may point only to a lower rank. Same-band imports are allowed when they remain within one architectural layer.

## Contents
- Direct files (22): `adaptive_poll.go`, `core_supervisor.go`, `core_supervisor_test.go`, `dispersal.go`, `dispersal_test.go`, `error_classifier.go`, `error_classifier_test.go`, `flow_observability.go`, `gas_fronting.go`, `gas_fronting_test.go`, `gsa_relay.go`, `gsa_relay_test.go` …

## Interfaces and dependencies
- Go package: `relayclient`.
- Notable exported surface: `AppsScriptRelayConfig`, `ClassifiedEndpointBackoff`, `ClassifyRelayErrorBody`, `ClassifyStderrLine`, `CoreEngineType`, `CoreLifecycleState`, `CoreSupervisor`, `DispersalConn`, `DispersalDialer`, `DriveStorageRelayConfig` …
- Daemon-local dependencies: `internal/foundation/flowregistry`, `internal/platform/system`.
- Direct daemon callers: `internal/runtime/proxy`.

## Invariants
- `integrations` code must not import a higher-rank daemon band.

